## Durable investigation contract

Follow global `worker-fix` / `e2e-cockpit`: FIFO/tick only. Dispatch sequence 0
has no heartbeat; run the exact `accept-dispatch`, start only on `accepted` /
`start_work=true` (sequence 1), then `heartbeat` running sequence 2. Duplicates
never restart a fix. Use `ask` / `access-prompt` with private typed body refs;
`pending` / `read-question` return durable mission-status JSON. Only explicit
human replies; `hold --answers` does not approve. Inspect
`status.pending_commands` / `command-status`; accepted-worker cancel/replace
needs accepted then applied ACK with matching digest and typed `--result`
after safely stopping/applying. Reuse IDs/digests; keep secret-bearing logs out
of the journal. Lifecycle and pane diagnosis are separate; no raw `send`/`nudge`
mission, approval or cancel shortcuts. Uninstrumented prompts need explicit
reporting; unaccepted recovery needs operator inspection, not worker killing.
